{"about_the_game":"Originally released as a Deus Ex: Mankind Divided game mode, Deus Ex: Breach is an innovative game that offers an arcade approach on the gameplay of the Deus Ex series, providing players with a unique connected puzzle shooter experience. As a Ripper in the year 2029, your objective is to obtain and sell classified corporate data by hacking into some of the world\u2019s most secure servers, using the funds you acquire to upgrade both your skills and arsenal. By obtaining this data, you will be able to unveil and expose the deepest, darkest secrets of the corporations in the Deus Ex Universe, with your efforts potentially unmasking some of the most dangerous individuals in the world. Extract the data. Expose the truth.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"16b4d9309b445dd8c191c9dd00967c8990dd06f1.jpg","localized_name":"Data Disciple","name":"Data Disciple","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/555450/16b4d9309b445dd8c191c9dd00967c8990dd06f1.jpg"},{"icon":"d8a6de459ab58e9b08831a3c17931a439a1f8479.jpg","localized_name":"Data Detective","name":"Data Detective","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/555450/d8a6de459ab58e9b08831a3c17931a439a1f8479.jpg"},{"icon":"378e4720a2684af8be4ecc70216072b37980a9e1.jpg","localized_name":"Data Expert","name":"Data Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/555450/378e4720a2684af8be4ecc70216072b37980a9e1.jpg"},{"icon":"4b0b9b1e3cd09a075cdefafca2102f48e955bb59.jpg","localized_name":"Data Master","name":"Data Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/555450/4b0b9b1e3cd09a075cdefafca2102f48e955bb59.jpg"},{"icon":"cab995cdfd5884dd98fa6e0a49bba4c3f0233377.jpg","localized_name":"Hourglass","name":"Hourglass","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/555450/cab995cdfd5884dd98fa6e0a49bba4c3f0233377.jpg"},{"icon":"b7feb4a840bb23e3b